      "kind": "start/sit",
      "text": "Keep Evans in at WR until the 49ers' inactives (about 2:55pm ET Sunday); if he's out, swap in DJ Moore.",
      "why": "ESPN still lists Evans Q (Achilles, expected back after SF's Week 8 bye) and Moore Q (knee, says he's okay after leaving late vs BAL). Evans plays Sun 4:25pm vs LV; Moore plays Mon 8:15pm at MIN, so Moore is still swappable once Evans' status is known. Watch Wed-Fri practice reports for both; if Evans logs full practices, this is moot."
    },
    {
      "by": "Claude",
      "kind": "waiver",
      "text": "Check waivers for a Sunday D/ST facing a weak offense, e.g. Eagles (vs NYG) or Chiefs (vs NYJ), to replace the Vikings.",
      "why": "Vikings D/ST projects just 4.1 vs a Bills offense that scored 36 on the Ravens, and it plays Monday night. Either suggested defense plays Sun 1pm at home; take whichever is actually available, only if it projects clearly higher."
    },
